   <p><p>Ghabrayegi zainab &ndash; 2<br />
Bhayya tumhe ghar jake kaha, paayegi zainab<br />
Ghabrayegi zainab</p>

<p>Ghabrayegi zainab &ndash; 4</p>

<p>Pardes hai gurbat hai &ndash; 2<br />
kaha jayegi zainab</p>

<p>Ghabrayegi zainab &ndash; 4</p>

<p>1. Tum saniye zehra ki garibi ko samajna<br />
Gaazi ki kasam hai tumhe bhai na tadapna<br />
beparda teri laash pe jab aayegi zainab</p>

<p>2. Kis tarha guzarungi qayamat ka wo lamha<br />
jab shaame gariba me mera bhai na hoga<br />
baba se nigahe na mila paayegi zainab</p>

<p>3. Insaaf karo kaise behen dil ko sambhale<br />
is gunj ka ehsaas muje maar na daale<br />
baagi ki behen shaam me kehlayegi zainab</p>

<p>4. Tum meri tarha gam ye akele hi sahoge<br />
wada karo ye baat na bano se kahoge<br />
zindaan me sakina ko jo dafnayegi zainab</p>

<p>5. Dekhi nahi jaayengi wo mayoos nigahe<br />
sughra jo use deti hai jine ki duayen<br />
Akbar ke bina jab bhi watan jaayegi zainab</p>

<p>6. Kya kya hua bazar me batlaungi kaise<br />
Abdullah &ndash; e &ndash; jafar ko mai samjaungi kaise<br />
jab nil rasan ke unhe dikhlayegi zainab</p>

<p>7. Bhai pe nazar karke takallum wo pukari<br />
bhayya mai samajti hu tabiyat ko tumhari<br />
accha ye sada lab pe nahi laayegi zainab</p>
</p>